  "sourceLocator": {
    "chapter": "Action Roll",
    "section": "6.11",
    "heading": "CONTROLLED",
    "lineStart": 398,
    "lineEnd": 409
  },
  "section": "6.11",
  "rulesText": "*You act on your terms. You exploit a dominant advantage.*\n\n* **Critical**: You do it with **increased effect**.\n* **6**: You do it.\n* **4/5**: You hesitate.\n    - Withdraw and try a different approach, or\n    - else do it with a minor consequence: a **minor complication** occurs, you have **reduced effect**, you suffer **lesser harm**, you end up in a **risky** position.\n* **1-3**: You falter.\n    - Press on by seizing a **risky** opportunity, or\n    - withdraw and try a different approach."
}
